From 61c18df2282c4856456dfd5f060429a5a11ed5c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:20:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(ui): ribbon rows and glyph ink are theme tokens

Each theme sets the tab row, the gaps, the caption row and the ribbon glyph
ink. The shell reads them from the active table. Fixes #2021

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
